window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three Dukes. Three Deadly Sins. Three Dangerous Games of Power, Temptation, and Love.</p> <p>Three commanding Dukes with dark pasts and the fierce ladies who bring them to their knees wait in this brand-new collection of the first three audiobooks in the <i>Seven Dukes of Sin</i> series:</p> <p>1. <i>Duke of Rath</i> (Beauty and the Beast meets Marriage of Convenience)</p> <p>Tormented by guilt and rage, Dorian, the Duke of Rath, agrees to a marriage of convenience—with the sister of the man whose death weighs on his soul. He vows never to touch her. But Patience Rose is stubborn, brilliant, and utterly irresistible. Each act of defiance chips away at his iron control... until she uncovers the dark secret that could destroy them both.</p> <p>2. <i>Duke of Luhst</i> (Brother's Best Friend Romance)</p> <p>Lucien Wrenn, London's most notorious Duke, can seduce any woman—except Lady Chastity, his best friend's sister. When a scandalous wager ignites a dangerous game of seduction, he watches helplessly as she transforms into a woman who drives him to madness. But giving in to temptation means losing everything he holds dear...</p> <p>3. <i>Duke of Pryde</i> (Grumpy Duke meets Sunshine Archaeologist)</p> <p>A cold-hearted Duke. A headstrong bluestocking. A marriage of necessity that changes everything. When blackmail threatens his impeccable reputation, the Duke of Pryde has no choice but to marry Miss Modesty Fairchild—a woman who despises his very existence. But each heated argument and unexpected smile brings him dangerously close to a truth he's desperate to deny...</p> <p>Note: This box set includes over 30+ hours of heart-pounding romance! Each audiobook in this collection is a complete standalone story in this interconnected series, and can be enjoyed in any order.</p>"; 
